# Build-context excludes for the Core Pod image (deploy/core.Containerfile).
# Podman reads `.containerignore` (Docker-compatible syntax). The build context
# is the repo root, so keep it small: no VCS metadata, no compiled binary, no
# runtime state, and — importantly — no probe/soak result trees (they carry
# SQLite databases).
.git
.gitignore
bin
state
state-*/
backups
workspace
spikes/**/results
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
cover.out
.DS_Store
